          <a class="row-card__heading glue-link" href=https://research.google/pubs/conditional-execution-of-transpiler-passes-based-on-per-script-feature-detection/ >
            
              Conditional Execution of Transpiler Passes Based on Per-Script Feature Detection
            
          </a>
        
        <div class="row-card__subheading">
          
            
              
                
                  
                    <div class="row-card__subheading__item small-text">
                      
                        <a class="row-card__small-link" href="/people/rishipalsinghbhatia/">
                          Rishipal Singh Bhatia
                        </a>
                      
